694 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Northern Gas and Power has built one of the largest\054 dependable networks in the utility sector\056 They provide expert and disciplined advice in procurement\054 energy services\054 and technology\056 To complete their already big offer\054 the company invested in R\046D to develop a set of IoT sensors and software to analyse and manage the distribution of consumption from yearly range down to millisecond \050RT\051\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 695 0 R
     /Pg 670 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
