698 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The biggest challenge with ClearVue is related to data visualization\072\na\051 the complexity and amount of details to be displayed in small widgets\056\nb\051 the software is destinated to different roles and different skillsets\054 from the technical personnel who will check data on a site while running an intervention\054 to the sales agent or the factory owner\056\n)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 699 0 R
     /Pg 670 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
