702 0 obj
  << /ActualText (After a quick survey ran with both persona types\054 it immediately came out that the huge difference in requirements from the different end users was a  show stopper\056 This obliged us to split the product in 2 different ones\072 ClearVue Alpha which is destinated to technical users and ClearVue Beta\054 which is suitable for non\055technical users\056\n\nI\047ve been involved in the process for ClearVue Beta\054 which is the mission\055critical product for the sales department and was requiring a discrete amount of research on data visualization\054 widgets and customer knowledge about utilities\056)
     /K [ 16 ]
     /P 703 0 R
     /Pg 670 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
